# Files that never belong in the packaged chart. The chart directory holds Chart.yaml, values.yaml and
# templates/ only; everything below is local state or test code that must not reach the chart package,
# the release assets or an OCI registry. Do not add a pattern that matches a file the chart needs:
# scripts/release-chart-source.sh compares the package with this directory and fails on a difference.
# CI also lists the package (scripts/check-artifact-contents.sh chart) and fails on any file that is not in
# its allow-list of chart files; add a new kind of chart file (values.schema.json, crds/) there too.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*~
*_test.*
testdata/
